{{Documentation/Header}}
A red warning notice marking a page whose subject contains mature content, and files it under [[:Category:Mature content]].

==Syntax==
{{T|Explicit|v1=content description}}

==Examples==
<pre>{{Explicit}}</pre>
<pre>{{Explicit|graphic violence and strong language}}</pre>
The optional parameter is appended as ", such as: ''…''" before the "View at your own risk" line.

